1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=83822800 Find a Grave]
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Jan. 23, 1945 Payson Utah County Utah, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Mar. 9, 2010 Spanish Fork Utah County Utah, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Jetta Dianne Walton Cloward, age 65, passed away Tuesday, March 9, 2010 .
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born January 23, 1945 in Payson, Utah to Bruce Lewis and Ruth Whittaker Walton.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Thomas J. Quinlan in 1967, and he preceded her in death. She married Ray Lindroth Cloward, April 4, 1993 in Orem, Utah. He preceded her in death July 23, 1996.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jetta earned a BS degree in Nursing from Brigham Young University. Her compassion and caring for others was exemplified by her 30 year nursing career. Jetta was a loving daughter, sister, wife, mother, grandmother and friend.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include: her son, Phillip J. (Angie) Quinlan, Salt Lake City; 3 grandchildren; siblings, Barbara Davis, Payson; Patricia Davis, Spanish Fork; Christine Ollerton, Springville; John Walton and Michael Walton, Green River, 
2 CONC WY. She was preceded in death by her son, Adam Thomas Quinlan.
2 CONT
2 CONT A celebration of her life will be held Saturday, March 13, 2010, 10:00 a.m., at the Walker Mortuary, 587 South 100 West, Payson.
2 CONT
