1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wilford is the son of Heber Chase Kimball and Mary Smithies.  He married Louisa Ella Free, Dec. 16, 1885, Logan, Cache Co., Utah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary ~ Deseret News, Thur. November 15, 1928, Page 6
2 CONT
2 CONT "WILFORD ALPHONSO KIMBALLL ~ At the family residence 2457 South Third East, Wilford Alphonso Kimball, 65, died Thursday.  He was born in Salt Lake October 6, 1863 and has been a resident of Salt Lake his entire life.  Surviving ar
2 CONC e 4 sons, Harold C., Ira F., Merl D., and Wilford W.; two daughters, Mary E. and Mrs. Abbie (Vernon W.) Mackay, all of Salt Lake; nine grandchildren; one brother, Lorenzo H., and a number of half brothers and sisters.  Funeral ser
2 CONC vices will be held Sunday at 2 p.m. in the Burton ward chapel with Bishop George Soderborg officiating.  Interment will be in City cemetery under direction of Deseret Mortuary.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded in death by parents and son, Marvin Wilford who died 22 Sep. 1904. Cause of Death: Cancer of Liver and Pancreas
