1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burial Information: Chipman, Malinda Porter Birth: 11/3/1814  Death: 12/17/1870  Burial: 0/0/0  Place of Birth:  Place of Death:  Cause of Death:  Grave Location: Porterville Cemetery, S/8  Source: Nathan Stuart & 
2 CONC Sexton  Comments: Spouse: Ezra Chipman  Grave Marker Comments: upright marker 
2 CONT
2 CONT Malinda Porter Chipman was born on Nov. 3, 1814 to Sanford Porter Sr. and Nancy Warriner at Augusta, Oneida, N.Y. Malinda Porter married Ezra A. Chipman on May 3, 1839. She died on Dec. 17, 1870 at Porterville, Morgan Co., Utah an
2 CONC d was buried at Porterville Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT In Memory of Malinda Chipman, Daughter of Sanford and Nancy Porter, Born Nov 3 1814 and Died Dec 17 1870 (The last part is illegible).
