1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fourth of five children born to Heber Chase Kimball and Mary Smithies.  Married Dorothea (Dora) Soren Christensen or Sorenson 22 Feb 1888, Logan, Cache Co., Utah. They were the parents of ten children.
