2 CONT OBITUARY ~  Deseret News, July 4, 1929
2 CONT
2 CONT "L. H. KIMALL ~ Funeral services for Lorenzo H. Kimball will be held at 12:30 p.m. Friday in the Central Park Ward chapel, with Bishop S. Leroy Richards officiating.  The body may be viewed at the home, 2651 Third East street, Fri
2 CONC day morning. Interment will be in the City cemetery under direction of the Intermountain Mortuary."
