2 CONC rditis ~ Source: Death Cert.). A native of Salt Lake, she was born Jan. 15, 1868.  Her parents were Heber C. Kimball, prominent in early history of the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints, and Mary Smithies Kimball. For 60
