1 NAME Sanford Marius /Porter/
2 GIVN Sanford Marius
2 SURN Porter
2 _MARNM Porter
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 5 AUG 1855
2 PLAC Centerville,Davis,Utah,USA
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 JUN 1933
2 PLAC Joseph City,Navajo,Arizona,USA
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sharing our Links to the Past by Wally and Frances Gray
2 CONT
2 CONT Sanford Marius Porter 1855-1933
2 CONT
2 CONT Father-in-law to Jesse S. Bushman, son of John Bushman and Lois Angeline Smith Pioneers and Prominent Men of Utah, p.1109
2 CONT
2 CONT PORTER, SANFORD MARIUS (son of Sanford Porter and Emma Ensign). Born Aug. 5, 1855, Centerville, Davis Co., Utah.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Nina Malinda Leavitt Sept. 4, 1879, Salt Lake City (daughter of George Leavitt and Sarah A. Porter), who was born Nov. 25, 1861, Richville, Morgan Co., Utah. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marius Earl b. July 8, 1880, d. Aug. 10, 1881; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Rulon Ensign b. Feb. 4, 1882; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Emma Ethel b. April 24, 1884, m. Edwin S. Westover Oct. 8, 1903; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Adah Janet b. March 23, 1886, m. J. Clark Owens; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Aaron Bond b. Aug. 23, 1887, m. Jane Rogers; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Miral Adrian b. Feb. 15, 1889, d. June 27, 1889; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mamie Teresa b. April 3, 1890; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Elva b. Feb. 1, 1892, m. Jesse S. Bushman; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Liona Ordell b. Feb. 6, 1894, d. Nov. 19, 1902; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Myron Leavitt b. May 13, 1896, d. Nov. 3, 1902; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Leo Fenton b. Feb. 24, 1898; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sanford Emil b. May 4, 1900; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nina Areta b. June 12, 1901; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thora b. Oct. 15, 1902.
2 CONT
2 CONT Moved from Porterville, Utah, to Sunset, Ariz. 1880, and to St. Joseph, Ariz. in 1884. Constable of St. Joseph precinct 1887-90; school trustee. High priest; member Snowflake stake high council. Farmer and stockraiser.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died June 14, 1933, in Joseph City, Navajo, Arizona
2 CONT
2 CONT ©1998-2007 Wallace F. and Frances M. Gray. This web page may be freely linked. To contact us send to grayfox2@cox.net  Their home page is http://www.geocities.com/wallygray25/index.html
