1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ==Wikipedia Biographical Summary:==
2 CONT
2 CONT "...'''Edward Stevenson''' (May 1, 1820 – January 27, 1897) was a prominent Mormon missionary of the 19th century. He also served as a general authority in The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints (LDS Church) as one of the
2 CONC  seven presidents of the Seventy.."
2 CONT
2 CONT "...Like most prominent Mormon leaders at the time, Stevenson practiced plural marriage, eventually marrying seven simultaneous wives, including two sets of sisters. He also ended up with a large number of children, at least 24...
2 CONC "
2 CONT
2 CONT >''SOURCE'': http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edward_Stevenson
