2 CONT
2 CONT Married Susan Leggett, 8 Nov 1861, Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Nancy Areta Porter, 11 Jul 1870, Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT LDS Biographical Encyclopedia, Andrew Jenson, Vol. 3, p. 343
2 CONT
