1 OCCU Neurosurgeon
1 TITL Dr
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Henry Hooper Blood and Minnie Ann Barnes
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Louise Jeanette McKay, 28 Dec 1927, Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Huntsville--Dr. Russell Henry Blood, 85, retired neurosurgeon, died Jan. 7, 1985, in an Ogden hospital after a long illness.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Blood practiced in Los Angeles and was involved in national medical oversight as deputy director of the Joint Commission on Accreditation of Hospitals.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of former Utah Gov. Henry H. Blood and was married to Louise Jeanette (Lou Jean) McKay, daughter of David O. McKay, former president of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Blood earned a bachelor's degree from the University of Utah and attended the Sorbonne University in Paris. He was granted a medical degree by the University of Pennsylvania where he was president of his class and of the John 
2 CONC Archer honorary society. He received the Piper Scholastic Award.
2 CONT
2 CONT He completed advanced training in neurosurgery at the Cleveland Clinic and the Neurological Institute in New York City.
2 CONT
2 CONT During World War 11 he was among a contingent of doctors from the Cleveland Clinic who were on medical duty in the South Pacific. He served on the hospital ship Repose during the Korean conflict, as well as with the U.S. Eight Arm
2 CONC y. He was decorated with the Bronze Star and retired as a medical officer from the Navy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Blood was a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints and served a mission in the British Isles. He later was name president of the French Mission.
2 CONT
2 CONT His funeral will be at noon Saturday in the Lindquist Kaysville Mortuary., 400 N. Maine St. Friends may call at the mortuary from 10 to 11:45 a.m. Saturday. Burial will be in the Kaysville City Cemetery. Imported from: UT State Hi
2 CONC storical Society Record added: Feb 02, 2000
2 CONT
2 CONT Find A Grave Memorial# 135894
