1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Of all the orphans of Beaver Creek least is known about this eighth child of Osten and Aase Sondreson of Bakkajord. She was born in Tinn on October 18, 1831 and came with her parents on the Brig "Noord" arriving in
2 CONC  New York Harbor on August 25, 1837. She was just six years of age when she came to America
2 CONT
2 CONT She went to Beaver Creek with the family little is know about her life or whereabouts. She is truly the missing orphan of Beaver Creek. It is speculated that she went with some other family and has been lost to us. She could have 
2 CONC retained the family name or adopted the name of the family that took her in.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is a lost child of this immigrant family.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.xmission.com/~rhubarb/bcrk-asse.htm
