2 CONT History - Alice Ann Kimball Smith has the unique distinction to be daughter of one LDS Church President - Heber Chase Kimball, wife of another - Joseph F. Smith, aunt to another - Spencer Woolley Kimball and step-mother to another
2 CONC  - Joseph Fielding Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice and Andrew (twins) were born In Salt Lake City about 11 years after its founding by LDS Pioneers. Their father died when they were about 10 years old and their mother died when they were about 21.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice has a twin brother, Andrew Kimball - father to 12th LDS Church President, Spencer Woolley Kimball.
