1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biographical Summary:==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Charlotte Chase''', born May 11, 1825, Bristol, Addison County, Vermont, daughter of Ezra and Tirzah Wells Chase, died December 15, 1904, Lewisville, Idaho. Married Heber C. Kimball October 10, 1844, sealed to HCK February, 7 1
2 CONC 846. No children by HCK. Separated from HCK in 1849, married Thaddeus C. Hix (or Hicks) in California, December 13, 1850, by whom she had six children. After his death in 1868 married William W. Dixson of Harrisville, Utah, in 186
2 CONC 9, whom she divorced in 1876 and then married Dr. Tyrus Hurd of Ogden, Utah
2 CONT >''SOURCE'': Kimball, Stanley B.; ''"Heber C. Kimball: Mormon Patriarch and Pioneer"''; page 308
