1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ruth Lavina Sadurna Pierce, Sex Female, Birth 11 February 1818 Oswegatchie, St. Lawrence, New York, United States
2 CONT Death 28 November 1907 Sevier, Utah, United States,  Burial 29 November 1907 Glenwood Cemetery, Glenwood, Sevier, Utah, United States.  Parents:   Rev. Isaac Pierce 1776-1859  and Elizabeth Taylor.  1776-1826  
2 CONT  Ruth Lavina Sadurna Pierce 1818 - 1907--
2 CONT birth 11 February 1818 Oswegatchie, St. Lawrence, New York, United States--
2 CONT marriage 2 May 1838 Euclid, Cuyahoga, Ohio, USA--
2 CONT other 3 February 1846 Nauvoo, Hancock, Illinois, United States--
