2 CONT When Ruth L. Pierce and her twin brother John T. were born on February 11, 1818, in Oswegatchie, New York, their father, Isaac, was 41 and their mother, ELizabeth, was 41. She had seven brothers and five sisters. She died on Novem
2 CONC ber 28, 1907, in Glenwood, Utah, having lived a long life of 89 years.
