2 CONT
2 CONT Widow.  Her husband (John Buckwalter) died in 1841.  Traveled with four of her children and one grandson.  She was re-baptized in the Salt Lake City 9th Ward on 16 Oct. 1852.  In the 1856 Utah census the family was in "Lake City" 
