2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Salt Lake City Cemetery Salt Lake City Salt Lake County Utah, USA Plot: J-13-12-1E
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Susan Record added: Jul 06, 2009 Find A Grave Memorial# 39124490
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT (son of Richard Smithies and Mary Robinson of Downham, Lancastershire, England). Born October 29, 1807, at Downham; pioneer September, 1847, George B. Wallace company, a part of Daniel Spencer’s 100.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Nancy Knowles in Lancastershire, England. (daughter of Robert Knowles and Ann Parker of Downham, England, pioneers September, 1847, George B. Wallace company). She was born August 2, 1809.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Mary born October 7, 1836, married Heber C. Kimball;
2 CONT             Robert born October 6, 1839, married Elizabeth Scott;
2 CONT             Joseph Richard born May 31, 1842;
2 CONT             James A. born October 11, 1845;
2 CONT             Sarah E. born July 5, 1847, married Ephraim Scott;
2 CONT             Alice A. born December 6, 1850, married Nelson Beebe.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Family home Salt Lake City.
2 CONT     Married:	Hannah Crowther 1857, Salt Lake City.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Joseph Heber born August 9, 1867;
2 CONT             Elizabeth born September 29, 1859;
2 CONT             John James born March 6, 1862;
2 CONT             Miriam born April 23, 1865;
2 CONT             Leah born May 11, 1868;
2 CONT             Lucy born October 12, 1870;
2 CONT             Melvina born November 27, 1872.
2 CONT
2 CONT Member 13th quorum seventies; organized the first choir in Salt Lake City. Farmer. Died June 26, 1882, at Salt Lake City. Sources:	
2 CONT
2 CONT     Pioneers and Prominent Men of Utah, page 1171
