1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alice married Samuel Raymond Kemp, December 29, 1868, Endowment House, Salt Lake City, Utah.  He died Februry 6, 1891.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice and Samuel were the parents of eight children: Samuel Raymond Jr.  William Marvin James LeRoy Alice Maud  Leo Arthur Anna "Laura"        Elmo Valentine      Sarah "Pearl"
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Samuel, Alice married Nelson Paul Beebe, January 6, 1894, Safford, Graham, Arizona.  He died February 21, 1912, in Safford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary ~ Deseret News, Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah, Saturday, April 5, 1919, Page 2
2 CONT
2 CONT "Funeral services for Mrs. Alice Kemp Beebe will be held Sunday, April 6, at 3:30 p.m., in the Waterloo ward chapel.  Interment will be in the city cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Beebe died last Thursday at her home, 369 east Seventeenth South street. She was 68 years old and is survived by three daughters and a son.  They are: Mrs. Maud Baker, Salt Lake; Mrs. Laura Bell (Belt)of Phoenix, Ariz.; Mrs. 
2 CONC Pearl York (Yorke) of Mayer, Ariz.; and Elmo Kemp, of Boulder, Mont."
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Certificate/Cause of Death:  Chronic Nephritis with Uremic Coma Place of Death:  L.D.S. Hospital, Salt Lake City, Utah
