1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=30039521 Find a Grave]
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Feb. 23, 1862 Salt Lake City Salt Lake County Utah, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Jun. 5, 1927 Salt Lake City Salt Lake County Utah, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse is the son of William Creeland Burrows and Catharine Louder. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Abbie Sarah Kimball on December 23, 1889 in Salt Lake City, Utah by Henry F. Burton, L.D.S. Bishop.
2 CONT
2 CONT William and Catharine are both buried at the Salt Lake City Cemetery, Salt Lake City, Utah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary ~ Deseret News, Tuesday, June 7, 1927, Page 6
2 CONT
2 CONT "BURROWS, Jesse B. ~ Funeral services for Jesse B. Burrows, who died at home, 2389 So. Third East street, will be held Wednesday at 2 p.m., in the Burton ward chapel, under direction of Bishop George A. Soderberg. Interment will b
2 CONC e in city cemetery."
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include his wife, Abbie Sarah Kimball Burrows; son, Jesse Kimball Burrows and wife Lydia F. Yates.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cause of death: Chronic Myocardial Insufficiency, Sclerosis. 
2 CONT
