1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (son of William and Annie Titcomb of Berkshire, England). Born In Berkshire. Came to Utah September, 1850, William Wall company.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Mary Atkins of Berkshire, who was born 1810.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Luke, married Lydia Jane Tanner;
2 CONT             Naomi, married Philander Bell;
2 CONT             John, Jr., married Susan Walpall;
2 CONT             Ruth, married Preston Free;
2 CONT             Mary, married Preston Free.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Family resided Lehi and Cottonwood, Utah.
2 CONT
2 CONT High Priest; teacher. Settled at Lehi 1853; moved to Cottonwood 1858. Shoemaker; farmer. Died 1858 at Cottonwood. Sources:	
2 CONT
2 CONT     Pioneers and Prominent Men of Utah, page 1215
