1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Desire Sanford''' [3] was born 12 Feb 1707, and is thought to have died 2 Jan 1795 at Hopkinton, Washington, Rhode Island, USA, although it is possible John was married to two other women after her, which would 
2 CONC put her death earlier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  not known
2 CONT
2 CONT Desire was a member of the Sabbatarian Church in Hopkinton, and is listed as an active member of the governing commitee until 1742.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: John Porter[1], born in 1710 at Hartford, Connecticut[2], died, probably in mid-1771, at Hopkinton, Washington, Rhode Island. His parents are not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Porter and Desire Sanford:
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 children of John and Desire (Sanford) Porter:
2 CONT # Timothy Porter[10], born 15 Dec 1725 at Westerly, Washington, Rhode Island[11]; death date unknown.
2 CONT # Hannah Porter[12], born 7 Nov 1728 at Westerly, Washington, Rhode Island[13]; died 17 Jul 1784.
2 CONT # John Porter[14], born 25 Nov 1730 at Westerly, Washington, Rhode Island[15]; md. 1754 at Palmer, Massachusetts[16], Ruth Merrick[17]; died in New York, death date unknown.
2 CONT # Desire Porter[18], born 11 Feb 1732 at Westerly, washington, Rhode Island[19]; death date unknown.
2 CONT # Sarah Porter[20], born 19 Aug 1735 at Westerly, Washington, Rhode Island[21]; death date unknown.
2 CONT # Samuel Porter[22], born 9 May 1737 at Westerly, Washington, Rhode Island[23]; died at Augusta, Oneida, New York[24], death date unknown.
2 CONT # Thankful Porter[25], born 7 Dec 1739 at Westerly, Washington, Rhode Island[26]; death date unknown.
2 CONT # Nathan PorterA,[27] born 26 Jun 1742 at Westerly, Washington, Rhode Island[28]; md. (1) 29 Nov 1764 at Hopkinton, Washington, Rhode Island[29], Hannah Witter[30], daughter of John and Annie (Davis) Witter[31]; md. (2) 26 Jun 178
2 CONC 5 at Union, Tolland, Connecticut, USA[32], Susannah (West) Tanner[33], daughter of Thomas and Susanna Amie (Colgrove) West[34], widow of Nathan Tanner[35]; died Dec 1815 at Vershire, Orange, Vermont, USA[36].
2 CONT # Esther Porter[37], birth and death dates unknown.
2 CONT
