1 NAME Thomas /West/ Sr.
2 GIVN Thomas
2 SURN West
2 NSFX Sr.
2 _MARNM West
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 AUG 1740
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hopkinton
