1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob Kunz was born on 05 August 1859 at Moos Riedern, Diemtigen, Bern, Switzerland to John Kunz II and Rosina Knutti Kunz.  He was christened on 28 August 1859.  He was baptized in the LDS Church on 12 May 1870.  
2 CONC He married Rosa Susanna Hirschi on 14 November 1882. Jacob Kunz and Rose Susanna Hirshi children included; Jacob Kunz and Wilford Kunz.  He married Edith Porter 27 June 1889.Jacob Kunz and Edith Porter children included Irvin Elme
2 CONC r Kunz and Bernice Kunz Webster.  Jacob Kunz age 31 died on 13 October 1890 at Montpelier, Bear Lake County, Idaho. He was buried in 1890 at Ovid Cemetery, Ovid, Bear Lake County, Idaho Research courtesy of; http://smith.indessed.
2 CONC com/individual.php?pid=I2530&ged=Smithphpgedview.ged Note: No known marker at this time.
2 CONT * Reference: [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;GRid=76166627 Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 5 2016, 23:58:14 UTC''
