1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Levi Stewart and Melinda Howard
2 CONT
2 CONT Two years after his marriage to Frances Ellen Van Hooser, she died. They were married 4 Jul 1862, Florence, Omaha, Nebraska, and had one son, John Clarence Stewart
2 CONT
2 CONT John Riley Stewart then married Eliza Stevenson on 16 December 1865, and had ten children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children - Eliza Melinda Stewart, Nancy Ellen Stewart, Clara Annette Stewart, Willard Levi Stewart, Lyman Eugene Stewart, Ezra Albert Stewart, Joseph Franklin Stewart, Clarice Stewart, Charles Herbert Stewart, Areta Stewart
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1883, John and Frances Ellen's son, John Clarence Stewart, went on a mission to New Zealand. When he returned home he brought home with him a little Maori boy. His name was Piriki Whaanga. He had been given to John as an expres
2 CONC sion of the Maoir's love towards John.  Perry was about eight years old. He lived with John Riley and Eliza and was loved as if he were their own. He lived only to his twenty-sixth year when he was fatally injured while riding a h
2 CONC orse.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza died at the home of her son, Eugene of acute pneumonia. Because of the extremely severe winter it was impractical to take the remains of Eliza Stevenson Stewart to Odgen for burial beside her husband, Clarence. So she was bu
2 CONC ried in the Montpelier City Cemetery near a beautiful evergreen tree. She had come to this very location many times to visit the grave of a dear friend, and she loved this particular setting. The family placed a stone marking her 
2 CONC last resting place.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source - Clarice Stewart Anderson, daughter
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT
2 CONT Levi Stewart (1812 - 1878)
2 CONT
2 CONT Melinda Howard Stewart (1816 - 1853)
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses:
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances Ellen Van Hooser Stewart (1845 - 1864)
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza Stevenson Stewart (1848 - 1934)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Clarence Stewart (1863 - 1905)
2 CONT
2 CONT Clara Annette Stewart (1869 - 1870)
2 CONT
2 CONT Willard Levi Stewart (1871 - 1888)
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyman Eugene Stewart (1873 - 1961)
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Franklin Stewart (1880 - 1938)
2 CONT
2 CONT Clarice Stewart Anderson (1882 - 1972)
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Herbert Stewart (1884 - 1928)
2 CONT
2 CONT Areta Stewart Beus (1888 - 1918)
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: S. M. Smith
2 CONT
