2 CONT *
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Son of John Riley Stewart and Eliza Stevenson
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Jennie Brown, 22 Sep 1895, Kanab, Kane, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Children - Julian Eugene Stewart, Willard Riley Stewart, Harriet Stewart, Jennie Stewart
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyman's early life was spent in Kanab where he was in the cattle business with his father and brothers. Lyman Eugene was in the stock business until his retirement. He was employed by Leary and Warren, stock shippers who had stock
2 CONC  yards in Ogden, Montpelier, Idaho and Pocatello, Idaho. At various time he worked at all of these locations.
2 CONT
2 CONT His later years were spent in Kaysville, Utah, where he had a home with enough acreage to pursue his hobby of gardening; he raise dpeonies for the spring flower market.
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of his wife he spent some time with his daughter in California, his grandchildren in Montana and with his son in Nevada.
