1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The many friends of Flora Porter Booth will be grieved to learn of her death on Nov 17th.  She has been ill for over a year, Tuberculosis being the direct cause of her death.  Interment was made in the Nephi Cemete
2 CONC ry on Monday Nov 21, 1921. To mourn her loss she leaves a devoted husband, Paul E. Booth of Nephi, Utah; a father, three sisters, and step-mother of Salt Lake City; and a brother, of Auburn, besides numerous other relatives and a 
2 CONC host of friends, both here, which was her former home and in Nephi, her home of the past few years. The community extends sincere sympathy to her loved ones in this time of their bereavement.
