2 CONT Besides Joseph and William, the couple had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT James, b. Mar 22, 1777 Luke, b. Dec. 10, 1778 Ezra, b. Feb 10, 1783 in Weathersfield, VT; resided Bethel, VT., died at Waitsfield, June, 1811; married 1808, Sarah Ainsworth, who died 1862. Children: Edward, Elvira and Ezra Dorothy
2 CONC , b. May 10, 1787, m. Apr. 3, 1814, Orson Skinner Betsey, b. Feb 27, 1789; m. Aug 18, 1807, Matthias Stone Jones Hooker, b. Apr 21, 1791 Minerva, b. Jan 13, 1793, m. Jan 23, 1814, Daniel Skinner Cyrus, b. May 23, 1703 Emily, b. Ja
2 CONC n 5, 1708, m. Mar 10, 1818, Horatio Rider. Sources
