1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MARY ANN BETTS
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Mary Ann Betts was born on April 22, 1800 in Rotherhithe, Surrey, England to William Cox Betts and Tresher Grant.  She led a most sheltered life in a well to do family.  She met and fell in love with Thomas James Whitaker who liv
2 CONC ed not far from her home.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Mary Ann was eight years younger than Thomas.  She did not know until Thomas sailed on an assignment to the East Indies that she was pregnant. Upon Thomas' return they immediately married.  She had two more girls.  Her children l
2 CONC oved her dearly.  She was not robust and died at 38 when the youngest was just three.
