2 CONT ==Wikipedia Biograpical Summary:==
2 CONT
2 CONT "...Tad Richards Callister (born December 17, 1945) has been the general president of the Sunday School of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints (LDS Church) since April 2014. He is the twenty-first man to serve in this 
2 CONC position. He was an LDS Church general authority from 2008 to 2014. He was a member of the church's Presidency of the Seventy from August 2011 to April 2014..."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tad_R._Callister
