2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Smith_Jr.#Family_and_descendants Wiki: Family and Descendants of Joseph Smith, Jr.]
2 CONT * [http://en.fairmormon.org/Joseph_Smith/Polygamy/Marriages_to_young_women Joseph Smith and Polygamy]
