2 CONT "For the first time made public, new evidence is revealed that purports that the recently identified photo/daguerreotype of Joseph Smith is authentic!  Steven's guest is Curtis Weber an independent researcher from Utah who has bee
2 CONC n conducting research on Joseph Smith's anatomy since 2008. His most recent work has been an analysis of the Larsen daguerreotype, a purported photograph of Joseph Smith which was announced to the world on July 21, 2022. On this f
2 CONC ar ranging presentation Curtis provides the forensic, artistic, and historic evidence that he believes proves that the daguerreotype is indeed an authentic image of Joseph Smith. 
2 CONT Original Photo Copyright Dan Larsen Colorized version Copyright Curtis Weber"
2 CONT [https://youtu.be/VZ-_wHcJ-xI]
