1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Viroque (whose age appears to match the photo), could not have the daughter of Caroline M. Williams, since Viroque was born in 1847, and Caroline was born in 1843! Only one census record (1870) is listed: https://w
2 CONC ww.myheritage.com/research/record-10128-72774481/viroque-kimball-in-1870-united-states-federal-census, where Viroqua (so written) is described as being born about 1852, and her race is Indian. She appears to have been adopted by t
2 CONC he Kimballs, which would explain the age discrepancies. One point to wonder - why has nobody noticed this before?
