1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dennisport first known as Crocker Neck and an area belonging to the Indians. Several families, among them Wixons and Chases, moved to Crocker Neck and lived among the Indians. This is where it is supposed the famil
2 CONC ies obtained the Indian blood that they  have. According to law, no white man could buy land off the Indians yet Chases and Wixons owned large pieces of the Crocker Neck area.Added about my Gr. Grandfather-  2nd Reg. Massachusetts
2 CONC  Light Infantry.   /ECN/
