1 NAME Sarah /Eldredge/
2 GIVN Sarah
2 SURN Eldredge
2 NICK Sally Eldredge
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 OCT 1777
2 PLAC Harwich, Barnstable, Mass.
2 ADDR
