2 CONT !OBITUARY:  "MAY" ELDREDGE -Deseret News July 1976 Catherine Woodbury Eldredge, 98, 4487 So. 3600 West, died July 17, 1976.    Born June 9, 1878, Salt Lake City, daughter of John and Sarah Bray Woodbury.   Married William N. Eldre
2 CONC dge September 16, 1903, Salt Lake Temple.  Charter member Daughters of Utah Pioneers, Relief Society block teacher for 50 years.    Survivors 2 sons, 1 daughter; William, Mendon, Utah; John, Helena, Montana; Erma, Granger, Utah; 8
2 CONC  granchildren, 19 great-grandchildren and3 great-great-grandchildren.
2 CONT Funeral services Tuesday 10 a.m. Taylorsville 25th Ward 2603 West 4700 South.  Friends may call Monday 6 to 8 p.m. at McDougal Funeral Home, 4330 South Redwood and Tuesday at the church one hour prior to services. Interment, Wasat
