2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Driggs Hubbard, age 86, passed away after a long illness in Stockton, California.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born November 14, 1899 in Holladay, Utah. She was born and raised in Holladay, active in the community, in the PTA, Highland Park LDS Ward Relief Society, Gold Star Mothers. Active DUP and various other activities.
2 CONT
