2 CONC  Smith, Walnut Creek, California; Madeline D. Waddoups, Hayward, California; 11 grandchildren; 11 great-grandchildren; preceded in death by a son, Jay Stanley Smith, who died in WWII and one brother, Vaughn B. Driggs.
2 CONT
