1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Franklin D. Farrington 83, 515 E. 27th South, died Oct. 1, 1975 in a Salt Lake hospital of complications during surgery. Born Sept. 5, 1892, Salt Lake City, to John and Elizabeth Brooks Farrington.  Married Lenore 
2 CONC Kimball July 17, 1915, Farmington, Utah.
