2 CONT Cal K. Farrington, 62, died Feb 17, 1979, in a local hospital. Born March 20, 1916, Salt Lake City, to Franklin David and Lenore Kimball Farrington.   Married Vera Chidester, Chapman March 21, 1937, Farmington, Davis Co., Utah; la
2 CONC ter divorced. Married Gladys (Jean) Roach, Fitzgerald April 16, 1945, in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah; later divorced.
