1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This is the third child born to Franklin David and Lenore Kimball, Farrington.  Her first name, Verona, is Lenore's sisters name.  She was known as Margie.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Margie was born at her family home, 521 No. 5th West at 1:00 a.m.  She died at the family home, 1622 Richards Street at 12:10 a.m.  The cause of death was listed as Acute Ileocolitis. Dehydration is the cause listed on the cemeter
2 CONC y record. She was eleven months and ten days old.  
2 CONT
2 CONT She was survived by parents; brother, Calthorpe (Cal) and sister, Donna. "Margie was a beautiful little girl. She had blonde curly hair; the only girl with curly hair.  When her eyes were closed, her eyelashes looked like a fan on
2 CONC  her cheeks." (Mother, Lenore)
2 CONT
2 CONT Margie was buried July 9, 1922.
