1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Donna is the daughter of Franklin David and Lenore Kimball, Farrington.    She married Adolph (Duff) Eugene Heller, June 3, 1939, SLC, SL Co., UT. (Div). Married Edward Charles Behm, August 27, 1948, SLC, SL Co., U
2 CONC T. (DIV). She had five daughters and raised Ed's two daughters after their marriage.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Donna attended West High School and in later years graduated from Granite High School. She continued her education at Stevens Henager Business College, then worked as a cashier for Mountain Fuel Supply where she retired. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Donna is survived by four daughters and one stepdaughter; brothers and sisters; Franklin (Bud) D., John K., Dorothy L. Nolte, Glen D., Bonnie M. Newman, and Kenneth 'R' Farrington. Preceded in death by parents; brother, Cal; siste
2 CONC rs, Marjorie and Lola G. Rosenlof; daughters, Judy Young and stepdaughter Cheryl Brown. She loved cooking, sewing, gardening and dancing.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Donna passed away at the Alta View Hospital.  Graveside services were held Monday, August 7, 2006.
