1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Obituary ~ Deseret News, Monday, January 5, 1981
2 CONT
2 CONT "Charles W. Archer, 96, passed away January 3, 1981, in a Salt Lake rest home after a short illness. Born September 5, 1885, in Bountiful, Utah, to William and Emma Titmus Archer.  Married Verna Lyle Kimball (June 23, 1909, SLC, U
2 CONC T), later divorced.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived in California for the past fifty years. Survived by son, Don K. Archer, Salt Lake City; five grandchildren; 13 great-grandchildren; sister, Ruth Haddow, Salt Lake City. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Graveside services Tuesday, 11 a.m., Salt Lake City Cemetery.  Friends may call Tuesday, 10 to 10:30 a.m., at the Mackay Cottonwood Mortuary, 4670 Highland Drive."
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles was preceded in death by daughter, Norma Olsen.
