1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "John Victor Hill, 76, 1713 S. 5th East, died Aug. 23, 1970, in a local hospital of natural causes. Born Dec. 2, 1893, Millcreek, Salt Lake County, to William N. and Louisa Snedaker Hill.  Married Vera Archer, Salt
2 CONC  Lake City, Divorced.  Owned Gold Medal Dairy; member LDS Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors; sister, Mrs. Richard (Louise) Mallonee, Murray; Miss Rose Hill, Miss Genevieve Hill, both Salt Lake City; Mrs. Angus (Marion) Wright, Carona Del Mar, Calif.; brother, Col. Guy C., San Antonio, Tex.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral Thursday, 1 p.m. 260 E. South Temple, where friends call Wednesday 7-9 p.m. and Thursday one hour before services.  Burial, Elysian Burial Gardens."  [Source: Deseret News ~ Mon 24 Aug 1970, Page B14]
