1 NAME Daniel H. Wells, LDS Apostle, Mayor of Salt Lake City, Utah
1 SEX M
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC He was a Mormon elder
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 OCT 1814
2 ADDR
3 CITY Trenton
3 STAE New York
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 MAR 1891
