2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Brigham was born 1 Jun 1801 1 in Whitingham, Windham, Vermont 1. He died 29 Aug 1877 in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah and was buried 2 Sep 1877 in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah. Brigham was baptized 14 Apr 1832. He was endowed
2 CONC  4 May 1842 in the Nauvoo.     Brigham married Miriam Works, daughter of Asa Works and Jerusha, on 8 Oct 1824. They were sealed 7 Jan 1846 in the Nauvoo Miriam was born 7 Jun 1806 in Aurelius, Cayuga, New York. She died 8 Sep 1832
2 CONC  in Mendon, Monroe, New York. Miriam was baptized Jul 1832. She was endowed 30 Mar 1877 in the St. George temple.
