1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hannah Kneeland, dau. of Edward Kneeland Jr. and Elizabeth Peck, was born 1811 in Hadley, Hampshire Co., Mass. She married with NATHANIEL PORTER on Nov. 9, 1822 in West Springfield, Hampden Co., Mass.. After she di
2 CONC ed, he married, as 2nd wife, with her sister Clarissa Kneeland.
