2 CONT *LDS pedigree: Altho the LDS pedigree states that she was born 1811 and married with Nathaniel Porter..the date of marriage, 11/9/1822, is really very unlikely; since she would have been only 11 years old at the time. RESEARCH IND
2 CONC ICATED.
