1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Thomas Porter''' was born in 1648 at Farmington, Hartford, CT and died on 27 March 1711 at North Kingston, Washington, RI. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Thomas Porter (b. c 1622, d. 13 Dec 1697) and Sarah Hart (b. c 1624, d. c 1697)
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT # before 1 December 1670 at Hartford, Hartford, CT to Lois Stanley (b. 23 Aug 1645, d. a 1711) daughter of Timothy Stanley (103-1648) and Elizabeth.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 children:
2 CONT # Lois Porter b. 1670
2 CONT # Timothy Porter+1 b. 2 Nov 1672, d. 6 Nov 1742
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Note==
2 CONT
2 CONT * According to the Stanley Family Book, published in 1887, Thomas Porter and Lois Stanley had only two children, Timothy Porter (B:1672) and Lois Porter (B:1670). Timothy Porter had 5 children, none of whom was named John. (Famili
2 CONC es of Early Hartford, Ct.) I don't find your John in any of my reference books. [2]
