2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Abiah (Sprague) West — married after 24 Dec 1709 (to before 7 Apr 1721) in Hingham, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay map icon [uncertain] Husband of Jane (Tanner) Hill — married about 1722 in Rhode Island map icon
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of William West, Benjamin West, Francis West, Thomas West and Ebenezer West
2 CONT
