2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/115775955/francis-west
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis West
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH	5 Aug 1735 Westerly, Washington County, Rhode Island, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH	9 May 1803 (aged 67) Grafton, Rensselaer County, New York, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT BURIAL	 Francis West Cemetery Grafton, Rensselaer County, New York, USA MEMORIAL ID	115775955
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis West was the son of William West (1681-1742) and Jane Tanner (1681-1742). William West was the grandson of George Soule who arrived on the Mayflower. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 02/17/1757, Francis West married Mary Lawton in Westerly RI and they had 8 known children: William, Betsey, Polly, James, George, Lawton, Esther and Nathan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Much of the family moved to the Grafton, NY area, probably in the early to mid 1790's.
