2 CONT
2 CONT Rev. John COLBY was born in 1764 in Rumford, Washington County, Vermont. He was baptized on 16 APR 1826 in Sardinia, Erie County, New York. He died in 1850 at Sardinia, Erie County, New York. He has Ancestral File Number XBRT-CC. 
2 CONC Parents: Capt. Ezekiel COLBY and Sarah/Sally FOWLER.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Abigail WEST. Rev. John COLBY and Abigail WEST were married on 27 MAR 1791 in Corinth, Orange County, Vermont. Children were: Rev. Thomas Wells COLBY, Eunice COLBY, Henry COLBY, John COLBY, Rev. Micheal COLBY, Susannah COL
2 CONC BY, Moses COLBY, Hezekiah COLBY, Stillman COLBY, Abigail COLBY, Nathan COLBY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Hannah BOARDT. Rev. John COLBY and Hannah BOARDT were married about 1819.
