1 NAME Carling Dorr /Allen/
2 GIVN Carling Dorr
2 _MARNM Allen
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC American Fork Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY American Fork
3 STAE Utah
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 5 AUG 1918
