1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Salt Lake Tribune
2 CONT Salt Lake City, Utah
2 CONT Tuesday, Feb 12, 1963, pg 23:
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph L. Jessop --- Joseph Lyman Jessop, 77, 6151-3rd East, died Monday 6 a.m. of natural causes.
2 CONT
2 CONT “Born Feb. 10, 1892, in Millville, Cache County, Utah. Married Winnie Porter, July 25, 1917. Later married Malet Porter Jan. 20, 1924. She died. Later married Beth Allred Jan. 6, 1934.
2 CONT
2 CONT “Survivors, sons and daughters: Edson P., Colorado City, Ariz.; Morris, Hamilton, Mont.; Lorin, Karl, Marvin, Lyman, Louis, Shem, Aaron, Leon, David, Harvey, Kathryn Allred, Mary Lavery, Ruth Johnson, Edith Allred, Louise Jenkins,
2 CONC  Faye Hansen, Florence Jones, Evelyn Anderson, Jane Jessop, Rachael Ann Scott, Shirley Clarke, Jeryl, Donna, Renae, Genevieve and Violet Jessup [sic, Jessop], all Salt Lake City; Ethel Daniels, Hamilton; and Evia Taylor, Lehi; bro
2 CONC thers and sisters: Richard, Virgil, Fred, Mrs. Faun Broadbent, Joseph, Ellen, Hyrum and Mabel Jessop, all of Colorado City, Ariz.; Mrs. Violet Barlow, Mrs. Alley Fores, Thomas, Albert, William and John, all Salt Lake City; Ruby Je
2 CONC ssop Bountiful; Sylmer Lewiston; Dowayne, Dayton, Idaho; 133 grandchildren and 7 great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contributor: Carolyn Dowd (49496097)* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/42684703/joseph-lyman-jessop Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 5 2022, 10:18:34 UTC''
