1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The above photo is from Family Search.org, and depicts Edwin Swen Westover with his mother, Joanna Matilda Erickson Westover, and his sister Laura Matilda Westover, who is behind their mother with her hand on the c
2 CONC hair in which her mother is sitting.  Edwin Swen Westover is the boy on the left and his half-brother, John Lycurgus Westover is the boy on the right. The girls are (center left) Mary Sophia Westover, and in front of her, Electa D
2 CONC rucilla Westover, and sitting in her mother's lap is Emma Westover Beckstead, and the girl on the right in front is Amelia Christena Westover.  John and the younger girls were actually the children of Joanna and her second husband
2 CONC  Henry Waters Despain, however, he was a friend of Joanna's first husband, Edwin Lycurgus Westover, and before he died, Edwin asked Henry to marry Joanna and raise a large family in his Westover name.  Joanna married Henry Waters 
2 CONC Despain April 14, 1879, and they had 7 children, although Joanna never used the surname Despain.
