2 CONT When Katherine Ellen Flannigan was born on 20 December 1869, in Atchison, Kansas, United States, her father, Patrick Flannigan, was 26 and her mother, Margaret, was 23. She married Charles M Lederer before 1888, in Denver, Arapaho
2 CONC e, Colorado, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 1 daughter. She lived in Central City, Gilpin, Colorado, United States in 1880 and Atchison, Atchison, Kansas, United States in 1885. She died on 8 April 196
2 CONC 1, in Kansas City, Jackson, Missouri, United States, at the age of 91, and was buried in Kansas City, Jackson, Missouri, United States. https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/99N8-46H/katherine-ellen-flannigan-1869-1961
