1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles (Chick) as most people remember him, was a great sportsman. He loved to fish and hunt. He did a lot of trapping. He worked on ranches for Deseret Livestock and Reese's most of his life. He died at the age o
2 CONC f 38.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Millie Porter. They had five children, Elsie, Beulah, Parley, Rita and O'dell. 
