1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nelda Moffett Schwab Allison died peacefully May 14, 1999 at her home in Salt Lake City. Funeral services were held at Schwab mortuary May 19, 1999.  Interment Afton City Cemetery.  A memorial service will be held 
2 CONC Monday May 24, 1999 at 7 p.m. at the Goff Mortuary 8090 South State, Midvale, UT. She was born Jan 5, 1917 in View, ID to Leander Armstead Moffett and Rose Hannah Gomm Moffett.  She attended schools in Cambridge and Burley ID befo
2 CONC re moving to Star Valley where she attended school and graduated from Star Valley High in spring of 1934 She met Joshua Wilford Schwab in high school and they married Aug 14, 1934 in Star Valley. Their three children are; Nelda Jo
2 CONC anne, Francis General, Gerald Josh "Jerry". In 1947 the family moved to Marshall AR where they owned and operated Searcy County Dairy Products (Cheese Factory) and a dairy farm.  During this time Nelda became and expert bookkeeper
2 CONC  and accountant as she took over the financial responsibility for the cheese factory.  Nelda was an active member and president in the local chapter of the Business and Professional Women's Club of America. They moved to Salt Lake
2 CONC  City in 1958.  Nelda was the office manger and bookkeeper for Peat, Marwick Mitchell Inc.  During this time she was a member of the Association of Professional Woman Accountants.  She retired in 1978. She married Lorenzo (Renie) 
2 CONC Allison Aug 11, 1978. Nelda enjoyed a long and productive life and will be greatly missed.  She is survived by daughter Francis Geneal Shouse, son Gerald Josh "Jerry" Schwab; sisters Fern McBride, Ruth Machen, Joye Brough; brother
2 CONC s, Russell and Bob Moffett; eight grandchildren. Nelda is proceeded in death by her parents, brothers, William, Rex and Leonard, daughter Joanne, husband Josh and second husband Renie Allison. In lieu of flowers the family request
2 CONC s donations to the American Cancer society for cancer research.
2 CONT
2 CONT Allison, Nelda Schwab (14 May 1999)Star Valley Independent
2 CONT
2 CONT NELDA MOFFETT is the daughter of LEANDER ARMSTEAD MOFFETT and ROSE HANNAH GOMM NELDA MOFFETT married JOSHUA WILFORD SCHWAB 13 AUG 1934 in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah
