2 CONT
2 CONT =Elizabeth Carter Osgood=
2 CONT * BIRTH 20 Oct 1720 Lancaster, Worcester County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 9 Oct 1755 (aged 34) in Lancaster, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT * BURIAL Old Settlers Burial Yard, Lancaster, Worcester County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 6238482 Photos by cap624
2 CONT
2 CONT She was baptized at Lancaster,MA on Oct 30,1720, and she was the wife of Joseph Osgood Jr.  She was the daughter of Samuel Carter and Dorothy Wilder and passed away in 1755. [1]
2 CONT
