2 CONT According to the Genealogy, Joseph was also married to Elizabeth Wood who died 1754 and Catherine Sawyer who died 1819.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Osgood-282
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Osgood
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 25 Jan 1720 in Lancaster, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay, British Colonial America
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Hooker Osgood Jr. and Mary (Wheelock) Osgood
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Mary (Osgood) Carter, Phebe (Osgood) Fowle, John Osgood, John Osgood, Keziah (Osgood) Ballard, Hooker Osgood, Dinah Osgood and Prudence (Osgood) Prentiss
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Elizabeth (Carter) Osgood — married 1 Feb 1740 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Elizabeth Osgood, Joseph Osgood, Joseph Osgood, Jonathan Osgood, Ezra Osgood and Dorothy (Osgood) Joslin
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1804 in Lancaster, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay, British Colonial America
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 31 Dec 2016 | Created 16 Jan 2013
2 CONT
2 CONT In addition to the children listed on the profile above, the children of Joseph were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorothy, born 1754 Ephraim, born 1757; died 1814 Katherine, born 1760, died, unmarried, 1814 Eunice, born 4 Aug 1762; died July, 1833; married, 10 Mar 1784, Thomas Wright, farmer, of Sterling, MA. Eunice and Thomas had 10 children
2 CONC  and at least 5 grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT A genealogy of the Descendants of John, Christopher and William Osgood, page 28 and page 50
2 CONT
