2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was born in 1742. She is the daughter of Joseph Osgood and Elizabeth Carter. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married Jonathan Wallis at Lancaster, MA, Mar 2, 1779
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Osgood-283
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth (Osgood) Wallis (1742 - 1808) 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Elizabeth Wallis formerly Osgood===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 19 May 1742 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Joseph Osgood and Elizabeth (Carter) Osgood
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Joseph Osgood, Joseph Osgood, Jonathan Osgood, Ezra Osgood and Dorothy (Osgood) Joslin
2 CONT Wife of Jonathan Wallis — married 2 Mar 1779 in Lancaster, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Mary (Wallis) Goodrich and Joseph Wallis
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 26 May 1808 at age 66 in Waitsfield, Washington, Vermont, United States
2 CONT
