1 NAME James Irvin (Ervin) /Collier/
2 GIVN James Irvin (Ervin)
2 SURN Collier
2 _MARNM Collier
1 NAME James Irvin Collier
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 28 AUG 1824 AND 28 AUG 1830
2 ADDR
