1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John Marlowe Taylor''' was born on April 28, 1885 in American Fork, Utah County, Utah, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34645000869 George Hamilton Taylor] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649112
2 CONC 668 Lois Louisa Foote]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-25725998 Ida Taylor Whitaker] on February 10, 1909 in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649113073 Elizabeth Whatak
2 CONC er (Taylor) Jeppson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on June 11, 1977 in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake County, Utah, United States and was buried on June 15, 1977 there. 
2 CONT ----
