2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT *Thelma Mendenhall Taylor (1905 - 1998)*
2 CONT *Jessie Gladys Mendenhall Clayson (1907 - 2000)*
2 CONT *Glen Terry Mendenhall (1912 - 1913)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Provo City Cemetery Provo Utah County Utah, USA
2 CONT
