2 CONT Married 12/16/1781 Trefeglwys
2 CONT
2 CONT Plaque on wall in St Michael " Departed from this life on 18th day of May 1834 in his 85th year of life " Burial is shown in Trefeglwys Parish records. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Ashton had a long drawn out will  so I cut corners to get the Heirs  I shall use the word omit to take out the ones that are not here 
2 CONT
2 CONT will dated 11 October 1834 Testator John Ashton Benefactors Valentine Ashton son messuage lands and hereditaments 
2 CONT                           to be passed to 
2 CONT
2 CONT                      John Ashton eldest  grandson and son of Valentine Ashton when Valentine dies 
2 CONT
2 CONT                       Elizabeth Chapman daughter the wife of Evan Chapman  1 pound 
2 CONT
2 CONT                        Mary Bennett daughter-- wife of Edward Bennett 1 pound 
2 CONT
2 CONT                        Edward Ashton Son one thousand and thirty four pounds 
2 CONT
2 CONT                        John Ashton son and executor
2 CONT
2 CONT                        Richard Ashton son 60 pounds and interest 
2 CONT
2 CONT                        Evan Ashton son and Executor two hundred and forty pounds 
2 CONT
2 CONT                        George Ashton son and his executor two hundred and twenty pounds 
2 CONT
2 CONT                        Thomas Ashton son one thousand thrity four pounds 
2 CONT
2 CONT                         Ann Edwards daughter wife of  Edward Edwards  one pound 
2 CONT
2 CONT                         Mary Lloyd granddaughter wife of Edward Lloyd one thousand thirty four pounds & interest 
2 CONT
2 CONT                        Andrew Ashton illegimiate son of son Edward Ashton  thirty pounds 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sons John and Evan Ashton to have titles of lands tenements and heredicts  place mentioned Gyssylia Issa Trefeglwys Gyssylva Ucha, Trefeglyws, Trefeglwys, Garth Llanidloes, Glanrafon Trefeglwys Others mentioned Edward Evans Garth 
2 CONC Llanidloes, trustee; Nicholas Bennett Glanrafon Trustee , Edward Mills tenant, Richard Pgh tenant, John Jones tenant, Andrew Bumford tenant, Edmund ...tenant, Evan Chapman son in law, Edward Bennett son in law, Edward Edwards son 
2 CONC in law Edward Lloyd son in law T Edmund Marsh witness James Morris witness John Owen witness.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Allison Bryan he possessed Gribbin-fach in 1834 when he passed.
