1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Martha Ann Hailstone, born April 06, 1862; married Thomas Conway Morris January 08, 1880; born October 07, 1858 in Cedar City, Iron CO, UT. 
2 CONT   Notes for Martha Ann Hailstone: (Dean Lufkin Hailstone)  On 6 April, 1862, during the General Conference time with President Brigham Young presiding, Martha Ann was born. On 8 Jan. 1880, when Martha Ann was 18 years old, she mar
2 CONC ried Thomas Conway Morris. Thomas was born 7 October 1858, in Cedar City, Iron County, Utah. He was 22 years old. They had eight children, five girls and three boys. One girl died in infancy. 
