1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Knute Sanderson was the son of Holge (Henry) Sondresen 1796–1855 and Aslaug "Adalaide" Knutsdatter Lofthus 1802–1887. 7 known siblings.
2 CONT
2 CONT He emigrated from Tinn, Telemark. Norway in 1843, and was a farmer.
2 CONT
2 CONT U.S., Evangelical Lutheran Church in America Church Records, confirm that Knute married Augusta Halverson in a wedding ceremony at the Evangelical Lutheran Indian Creek Congregation on 9 May 1856 at Leland Illinois. Their known ch
2 CONC ildren were: Adelaide Sanderson 1857–1903; Sarah Sanderson 1858–1894; Henry Sanderson 1860–1939; Margaret Louise Sanderson 1862–1942; Simon Sanderson 1864–1898; Agnetta "Nettie" Cordelia Sanderson 1866–1931; and Carrie Sanderson 1
2 CONC 870–1906.
2 CONT
2 CONT Augusta and the children were saddened in 1899, their dear husband and father had passes away. A burial plot was chosen for him in Baker cemetery. The family and friends gathered on the day he was buried to bid him a fond farewell
2 CONC  and to rest in Peace.
2 CONT
