1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Bess" or "Bessie" is Elizabeth Shuker Clark, daughter of William Bell Clark and Frances Davies Clark. She married Edward Rodebeck in 1890. She married Edwin James Butterfield in 1910. She married Ray Chase Kimball
